  "factor_name": "Stress Transition Residual Momentum",
  "version": "1.0",
  "calculation": {
    "expression": "residual_return_5d / lagged_volatility_20d, activated when lagged downside breadth > 60%, lagged 20d market return < 0, and lagged cross-asset vol20/vol60 - 1 > 15%",
    "description": "Cross-sectional residual momentum during broad bearish volatility transitions. Residual return is each asset's 5-day return minus the contemporaneous cross-asset mean, scaled by lagged 20-day volatility. The activation regime and all inputs are lagged one day."
